---
description: maxi-bot monorepo rules
alwaysApply: true
---

Follow `AGENTS.md` at repo root. Entry point.

Reminders:
- Layered: `shared` ← `workflows/*` ← `interfaces/*`. Validated `tools/check_layers.py`.
- Two-layer config: env via `shared.config.Settings`, knobs via `<workflow>.config.<Name>Config`. Never mix.
- LangChain primary, LangGraph only when justified (ADR-003).
- No tests. Verify with `uv run smoke <id> <path-or-url>` (ADR-001, ADR-012).
- pre-commit runs ruff+ty+check_layers on `git commit`. Don't bypass.

Skills in `.skills/`. Read before scaffolding.
